# decision-mixed-semand-reduction root (#189 2d panel round 2 — mixed guard loud-gate)
library "Pol".

// A decision whose guard MIXES a code-bearing `exists this` reduction AND a code-LESS
// `count` reduction via `sem-and`. The code-less "Enough Trials" contributes no gatherable
// case-feature (the collector does not descend a reduction's operand "Trial Records"), so the
// guard is INCOMPLETE — it must LOUD-GATE (unsupported-casefeature-reduction), not ship a
// partial guard that can never be satisfied at $apply.

concept "Code Bearing":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `cb`.
- definition is exists this.
concept "Trial Records":
- type is Procedure.
- shape is RecordSet.
- code is `trial`.
concept "Enough Trials":
- value type is boolean.
- definition is count "Trial Records" at least 2.
concept "Mixed Guard":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as ( "Code Bearing" sem-and "Enough Trials" ).

activity "Refer to GI":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Cov Determination":
- when "Mixed Guard" then recommend activity "Refer to GI".
